Module: Single Notification
Author: Thomas Seifert

This module limits the notifications to one per thread until the forum is visited again.

Installation instructions:
--------------------------

- Unpack the archive;

- Move the directory "single_notification" to the directory "mods"
  within your Phorum installation;

- Login as administrator in Phorum's administrative interface and
  go to the "Modules" section;

- Enable the module "Single Notification".

Integration Note:
-----------------
This module has been integrated with the `forum_subscriptions` module (inside `forum_subscriptions_after_post.php`). When immediate subscriptions are processed, this module's DB constraints are evaluated, ensuring that users only receive a single email notification for replies until they visit the thread/forum.


